# Cloudflare Pages: copiado para a raiz de dist/ pelo `expo export`. Mínimo da Fase 1; revisar no TRD (segurança e CSP).
# COOP/COEP: exigidos pelo expo-sqlite no web (SharedArrayBuffer). Verificados com `wrangler pages dev`.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

# Bundles com hash no nome: cache longo.
/_expo/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
